  "name": "Corrupted Blade spreads only after a landed blade attack (#6469, PR #6790 P2)",
  "contract": [
    "Corrupted Blade 281492 spreads owned Corruption from the struck target through helper 281493. A failed hit",
    "has no struck target. Submit ordinary Sinister Strike 1752 and Gloomblade 760050 to a hostile player facing",
    "the attacker with native 100-percent dodge 10020, parry 10019, and school immunity 1022 plus 6356. The",
    "attacker has hit rating but no expertise. Observe completed native spell-go packets and zero direct damage",
    "before requiring the nearby enemy to remain uncorrupted. Reapply owned Corruption before each defense, and",
    "prove the immunity auras retain it. The separate native-spread scenario supplies landed attacks, ownership,",
    "amount, duration and range controls. This fixture proves combat behavior, not roll acquisition or client",
    "rendering."
  ],
